		{
			dependencies: ["ED923ADC90127182", "0E2E13522BA2A323"]
			description: [
				"The steam &6Furnace&r smelts like any other furnace, just faster with good fuel."
				"The &6Alloy Smelter&r turns copper and tin dust straight into bronze ingots in one step - no separate mixing. Same trick works for red alloy, from copper and redstone dust."
